WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:06,580
What bad luck

2
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:09,260
I'm sorry that I bumped into Mr. Tang Lang Ling.

3
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:10,940
We didn't know this was your territory

4
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:12,900
How about we leave now?

5
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:16,380
We don’t know each other, we have met before

6
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:19,120
You birds don’t have a very good memory either.

7
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:20,760
Give you some tips

8
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:22,000
three days ago

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:27,570
Blocked the two Tang Langs into a tree hole

10
00:00:27,570 --> 00:00:28,570
There is such a thing

11
00:00:28,570 --> 00:00:30,450
Do you think there are any of your people in Qidong?

12
00:00:30,450 --> 00:00:31,490
I'm so sorry

13
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:32,490
Excuse me, brother

14
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:35,890
Hahahaha wrong

15
00:00:35,890 --> 00:00:37,370
I am not Lord Ling

16
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:42,970
But one of the ones you blocked in the tree hole

17
00:00:42,970 --> 00:00:47,010
Are you kidding me?

18
00:00:47,010 --> 00:00:49,810
Who has time to joke with you?

19
00:01:18,850 --> 00:01:22,250
Starving ghost reincarnation, misunderstanding, misunderstanding

20
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:23,810
Keep a bird under your breath
